\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia \highlight\uc2 's Rupiah Up Early On Bank  \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia \highlight\uc2 's  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 262 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 13 November 1997\par 02:53\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JAKARTA (AP-Dow Jones)--\b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's rupiah strengthened against the U.S. dollar in quiet dealings early Thursday after Indonesia's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  sold the dollar in small amounts, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  The dollar was trading at 3,377.50 rupiah in the spot market at 0145 GMT (8:45 p.m. EST), down from its close Wednesday at 3,415 rupiah. \par \par \uc2  'After being absent during the last three days, Bank Indonesia was in again early Thursday,' said a dealer with a local bank. \par \par \uc2  Dealers attributed the rupiah's slide late Wednesday beyond 3,400 rupiah to Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's absence from the market. \par \par \uc2  Despite Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , dealers see the market is trying to push the dollar higher again to test the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's resolve. \par \par \uc2  'To make sure that 3,400 rupiah is the resistance Bank Indonesia is setting for the dollar, the market must test the level again,' a nother dealer said. \par \par \uc2  Market participants added that demand for the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  from local companies still exists and is expected to support the dollar at 3,300 rupiah Thursday. \par \par \uc2  Liquidity of the rupiah was still good early Thursday as Bank Indonesia injected 1.9 trillion rupiah into the system. Good liquidity sent the overnight rupiah interbank offered rate down to 15% from 20% at its open. While the overnight swap rate remained depressed at -0.25 rupiah/-0.10 rupiah. \par \par \uc2  -By I Made Sentana (62-21) 350-0145 \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 13-11-97 \par \par \uc2  0153GMT \par \par \uc2  1159 1848 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dtbd08ofc\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
