\par\par \b \uc2  Indonesian rupiah recovers on  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2 . \b0\par\par\uc2 277 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 13 November 1997\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1997 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  JAKARTA, Nov 13 (Reuters) - The Indonesian rupiah recovered against the dollar in early trading on Thursday after the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets in both Jakarta and Singapore, bank dealers said. \par \par \uc2  They said the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the amount of which was described by dealers as "moderate", helped strengthen the rupiah and stopped it from breaching the 3,400 psychological barrier. \par \par \uc2  They said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , Bank Indonesia, sold dollars all the way down from 3,400 to 3,355. \par \par \uc2  Spot rupiah was quoted at 3,355.0/3,375.0 against the dollar at 0315 GMT, against an opening of 3,395.0/3,405.0. \par \par \uc2  "It's something that they certainly have to do because letting the rupiah fall below that psychological barrier would lead to more uneasiness, particularly among local corporates," another foreign bank dealer said. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was believed to have \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market after the rupiah had earlier fallen to 3,415 against the dollar. \par \par \uc2  In Tokyo, Japan's \b \highlight22\uc2 Ministry of Finance\b0 \highlight\uc2  (MOF) declined to comment on whether the Bank of Japan (BOJ) had taken part in the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Tomorrow and today rupiah were both at 3,375/90. \par \par \uc2  Overnight swap was at -0.5/-0.4, tom/next at par/0.10, spot/next at 0.5/0.8, one-week at 6.0/6.5, one-month at 35/45, two at 70/90, three at 110/120, six at 210/240 and one-year at 430/470. \par \par \uc2  -- Jakarta newsroom (6221) 384-6364; Fax (6221) 344-8404 \par \par \uc2  -- Email: jakarta.newsroom@reuters.com \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1997 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011003dtbd02liu\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
