\par\par \b \uc2  SE Asian  \highlight22\uc2 Currencies \highlight\uc2  Boosted By Further Rupiah  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2  By Tom Holland \par \uc2 230 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 6 November 1997\par 12:50\par \uc2  Capital Markets Report \par \uc2 CM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par    SINGAPORE (Dow Jones)--The central banks of \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Indonesia\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 \par and Singapore again waded into regional \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 \par markets on Thursday to halt the rupiah's slide against the\par U.S. dollar.\par    The \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , which took place in thin afternoon\par trading, forced the embattled Indonesian \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  up by 2.5%\par within a matter of minutes. And as with Monday's tripartite\par action by Bank Indonesia, the Bank of Japan and the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Monetary\par Authority\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  of Singapore, other regional \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  rose in\par parallel, with the Malaysian ringgit and the Singapore\par dollar strengthening sharply.\par    Traders' estimates of the sums spent in the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 operation\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 \par varied widely. Some said that, given the illiquidity of the\par market, no more than $200 million worth of rupiah had been\par bought. Others said the central banks spent as much as $1\par billion.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par    Many market participants suspected that, as on Monday,\par the Bank of Japan also took part in the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , but\par while the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Monetary Authority\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  of Singapore confirmed its own\par participation, a spokesman for the Japanese \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 \par declined to comment on the issue.\par    The strategy behind the recent joint \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 interventions\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , say\par many analysts and traders, is not necessarily to punish\par speculators and drive them out of the market, but rather to\par maintain the rupiah within a stable trading range.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (MORE) DOW JONES NEWS  11-06-97\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 0650EST\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  1136 4340 \par \par \uc2 Dokument cm00000020011006dtb602dam\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
