\par\par \b \uc2  Indonesia's Rupiah Lower Late But Off Intraday Low \b0\par\par\uc2 313 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 5 November 1997\par 11:03\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JAKARTA (AP-Dow Jones)--Indonesia's rupiah was trading lower against the U.S. dollar in subdued dealing late Wednesday but rebounded from its intraday low on suspected \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , and the Malaysian ringgit's late surge, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  After rising to an intraday high of 3,350 rupiah, the dollar was trading at 3,310 rupiah in the spot market at 0940 GMT (4:40 a.m. EST), up from its close Tuesday at 3,270 rupiah. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the dollar was well bid for most of the day on its bullishness against all Asian \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 . Dealers added that Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2 , selling the dollar at 3,340 rupiah in small amounts, driving the unit down to 3,305 rupiah. \par \par \uc2  Other dealers, however, said that the rupiah's sharp gain was not due to Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . They said Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  only checked the exchange rate. \par \par \uc2  'It was the ringgit's surge (versus dollar), which triggered short-covering on the rupiah,' said a dealer with a local bank. \par \par \uc2  Dealers expect the U.S. unit to continue to trade between 3,200 rupiah and 3,350 rupiah Thursday. \par \par \uc2  'It seems that for the time being the rupiah is trying to find its equilibrium between this range,' a dealer with a joint venture bank in Jakarta said. But he sees a lot of interest in buying the dollar for debt hedging. \par \par \uc2  Liquidity of the rupiah turned out to be good late Wednesday, dealers said. The overnight rupiah interbank offered rate eased down to 15% after rising to 30%. But the rate of the tomorrow/next day swap fell to 1.00 rupiah/1.75 rupiah from 3.00 rupiah/5.00 rupiah. \par \par \uc2  -By I Made Sentana (62-21) 350-0145 \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 05-11-97 \par \par \uc2  1003GMT \par \par \uc2  1159 1848 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dtb508fe1\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
