\par\par \b \uc2  SE Asia  \highlight22\uc2 Currencies \highlight\uc2 /Early-2: Rupiah Dn As Fin Min Attacked \b0\par\par\uc2 239 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 5 November 1997\par 03:37\par \uc2  Capital Markets Report \par \uc2 CM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par    Offshore market participants began buying U.S. dollars\par after Bambang Trihatmodjo, second son of Indonesian\par president Suharto, launched an attack on Finance Minister\par Mar'ie Muhammad.\par    Bambang vowed to contest the finance ministry's planned\par closure of a bank in which he owns a 25% stake.\par    Traders saw the development as extremely negative for\par the rupiah, because they fear it may jeopardize Indonesia's\par IMF-inspired program to shore up its shaky banking system.\par    One trader at a U.S. bank predicted that the U.S. dollar\par would trade as high as 3,350 rupiah Wednesday, possibly\par testing 3,400 rupiah. He largely discounted the threat of a\par repeat of Monday's three-way \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  by\par Bank \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Indonesia\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , the Bank of Japan and the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Monetary Authority\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 \par of Singapore.\par    "The central banks will not come in to sell dollars\par until the market is looking long (dollars)," he said.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par "\f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  would not be effective unless the market is\par long."\par    Elsewhere in the region the dollar is also higher\par against the Thai baht as political uncertainties continue to\par weigh on the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 . At 0230 GMT (9:30 p.m. EST) the U.S.\par dollar is quoted at 39.5750 baht, up from 38.4350 baht late\par Monday.\par    -By Tom Holland; 65- 421-4800;\par tom.holland@djmarkets.com.sg\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (END) DOW JONES NEWS  11-04-97\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 2137EST\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  1136 4340 \par \par \uc2 Dokument cm00000020011006dtb502dkx\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
