\par\par \b \uc2  Indonesian rupiah weakens on technical correction. \b0\par\par\uc2 464 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 5 November 1997\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1997 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  JAKARTA, Nov 5 (Reuters) - The Indonesian rupiah weakened against the dollar in moderate early trading on Wednesday due to technical correction after recent sharp rises, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  The rupiah edged down to 3,325/35 at 0245 GMT from an opening of 3,250/3,300 on Wednesday. Tomorrow and today rupiah were at 3,320/30 and 3,317.5/27.5 respectively. \par \par \uc2  "I think it's mainly a technical correction, coupled with weaker regional \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," one foreign bank dealer said. \par \par \uc2  "From an interest rate point of view, the rupiah should strengthen, but it weakened instead. I think it's a correction to Monday's sharp rises," one Singapore-based dealer said. \par \par \uc2  The rupiah rallied on Monday as three central banks rode on momentum sparked by Jakarta's economic reform to support the rupiah. It rose eight percent due to the coordinated \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the Bank of Japan, the \b \highlight22\uc2 Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  of Singapore and Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Dealers said liquidity was tight as the Monday \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  took effect. Traders said the value of the concerted dollar sales on Monday was estimated at $300 million to $500 million. \par \par \uc2  Overnight rupiah at good name banks was around 35/40 percent and was selectively taken at 125 percent. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said tight rupiah supply narrowed short-dated interest rates between Jakarta and offshores. Overnight swap was at 3.0/3.5 and tom/next at 4.0/4.5 points. \par \par \uc2  But longer-term rates were widening. In Jakarta, one-week swap was at 15/25, one-month at 35/75, two at 70/120, three at 110/160, six at 230/280 and one-year at 450/550 points. \par \par \uc2  In Singapore, one-week swap premium was at 45/65, one-month at 105/135, two at 150/170, three at 180/220, six at 300/330 and one-year at 500/560 points. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said increased corporate demand for dollars added to the soft rupiah tone. \par \par \uc2  They said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had been checking rates regularly in the market on Wednesday, but \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  had not been seen. \par \par \uc2  Some dealers in Singapore said the market was cautious on reports that President Suharto's son Bambang Trihatmodjo planned to sue Finance Minister Mar'ie Muhammad as his bank was among the 16 banks shut down last Saturday. \par \par \uc2  "This is not a major factor in the market yet. But people are watching closely. It's not a good development for rupiah sentiment," another Singapore-based dealer said. \par \par \uc2  Trihatmodjo, angered by the government's closure of Bank Andromeda in which he has a 25 percent stake, said Mar'ie was trying to discredit the president's family. \par \par \uc2  -- Jakarta newsroom (6221) 384-6364; Fax (6221) 344-8404 \par \par \uc2  -- Email: jakarta.newsroom@reuters.com \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1997 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011003dtb5039zd\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
