\par\par \b \uc2  Indonesia Rupiah Lower Late On Regional  \highlight22\uc2 Currency \highlight\uc2  Weakness \b0\par\par\uc2 250 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 15 Oktober 1997\par 12:26\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JAKARTA (AP-Dow Jones)--Indonesia's rupiah was trading lower against the U.S. dollar in quiet dealings late Wednesday on the slide of other \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the region, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  The dollar was trading at 3,580 rupiah in the spot market at 1018 GMT (6:18 a.m. EDT), up from its close Tuesday at 3,500 rupiah. \par \par \uc2  'The weakness of the regional \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  and rumors that one large Indonesian company is defaulting on its debt sent the rupiah down,' said a dealer with a local bank. \par \par \uc2  The rupiah continued to fall despite the repeated \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  of the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 . Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  was seen \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  several times Wednesday when the dollar was trading between 3,490 rupiah and 3,500 rupiah. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  suggested that Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  had initially set the limit for the dollar rise at 3,500 rupiah, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  'But, Bank Indonesia let the dollar rise above 3,500 rupiah in the afternoon session because, I think, Bank Indonesia realized it would be futile to stop the dollar from rising while other units in the region fell,' a dealer added. \par \par \uc2  Regarding the bullish tone on the dollar Wednesday, dealers still expect the U.S. unit to remain well bid Thursday, while the market awaits fresh incentives. \par \par \uc2  The overnight rupiah interbank offered rate slid to 17% late Wednesday from 20% Tuesday on improved rupiah liquidity, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 15-10-97 \par \par \uc2  1026GMT \par \par \uc2  1159 1848 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dtaf07pij\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
