\par\par \b \uc2  Bk  \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia \highlight\uc2 / \highlight22\uc2 Intervenes \highlight\uc2 -2: Dlr's Top Seen At 3,500 Rupiah \b0\par\par\uc2 155 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 15 Oktober 1997\par 07:10\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JAKARTA (AP-Dow Jones)--\b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2 , \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  by selling dollars in the spot market early Wednesday when the dollar was trading at 3,495 rupiah, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  The amount of the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  was small, according to a dealer in one \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  house. \par \par \uc2  As usual, officials at Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  declined to comment on the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  was also cited selling the dollar Tuesday both in Jakarta and Singapore dealings when the dollar was quoted between 3,495 and 3,500 rupiah. \par \par \uc2  'The \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  suggest that Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  has defined the topside limit for the dollar at 3,500 rupiah,' a dealer said. \par \par \uc2  The dollar was trading at 3,495 rupiah at 0455 GMT (12:55 a.m. EDT), a touch lower than its close Tuesday at 3,500 rupiah. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 15-10-97 \par \par \uc2  0510GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dtaf07n7i\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
