\par\par \b \uc2  Indonesian rupiah fluctuates below 3,700 level. \b0\par\par\uc2 290 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 7 Oktober 1997\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1997 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  JAKARTA, Oct 7 (Reuter) - The Indonesian rupiah fluctuated below the 3,700 level against the dollar in moderate early trading on Tuesday, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  They said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was heard in the market with small amounts, pushing the dollar down to a low of 3,475 from an opening of 3,600/50. \par \par \uc2  But the dollar clawed back to the 3,650 level on sustained demand from both local and foreign parties, before another wave of rupiah buying took it to 3,600. \par \par \uc2  Spot rupiah was quoted at 3,600/30 at 0216 GMT. \par \par \uc2  "We hear Bank Indonesia was in the market again along with Bank Negara on the Malaysian side," said one foreign bank dealer, adding however this could not be confirmed. \par \par \uc2  Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , has been \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market since Monday after the rupiah hit a historic low of 3,850. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said stronger rupiah closing in New York and London overnight helped improve sentiment at the opening in Jakarta. \par \par \uc2  State Secretary Murdiono said on Monday the government would take steps to stabilise the value of the rupiah. \par \par \uc2  "Hopefully in the coming days, the government will inform the people what steps will be taken," he said. \par \par \uc2  "We remain committed to maintaining free \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  flows. The government will not set a rupiah value," he said. \par \par \uc2  Liquidity was sufficient, but state banks continued their drain, keeping overnight money at 30/33 percent. \par \par \uc2  One dealer said swap rates tended to soften earlier, but talk of \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  led the market to anticipate possible liquidity strains, which reversed the trend. \par \par \uc2  -- Jakarta newsroom (6221) 384-6364; Fax (6221) 344-8404 \par \par \uc2  -- Email: jakarta.newsroom@reuters.com \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1997 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011001dta701kuy\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
