\par\par \b \uc2  =SE Asian  \highlight22\uc2 Currencies \highlight\uc2  -2: Ringgit Jumps On Misquoted Rates \b0\par\par\uc2 255 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 7 Oktober 1997\par 13:53\par \uc2  Capital Markets Report \par \uc2 CM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par    Market participants were left fuming however, after the\par error caused a sell-off which saw the Malaysian \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 \par jump to a high of 3.2450 ringgit to the U.S. dollar from\par 3.3680 ringgit at the start of Asian trading just over two\par hours before.\par    Other Southeast Asian \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  also strengthened,\par with the Indonesian rupiah strengthening to 3,510 rupiah to\par the U.S. dollar from 3,740 rupiah at the open, although\par other factor were at play as well - including reports of\par more \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  by Bank \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Indonesia\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , the country's \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central\par bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 .\par    "It is very disturbing that this can happen. Everyone\par was selling U.S. dollars because they thought there really\par was a two-tier market for all the Asian \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 ," said\par the head of regional \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  at a European bank in\par Singapore.\par    "There was no intention to mislead the market into\par thinking that was what was actually happening. It is very\par unfortunate that this happened with conditions in the market\par as they are," said Suzuki at Reuters.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par    The errors were rectified within about three hours of\par the Asian open and trading in the ringgit and the rupiah\par calmed. The Malaysian \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  finished Asian trading\par Tuesday at 3.2755 ringgit to the dollar, well up from 3.3660\par ringgit at Monday's close.\par    The rupiah also finished higher, at 3,690 rupiah to the\par U.S. dollar, from 3,707.50 late Monday.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (MORE) DOW JONES NEWS  10-07-97\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 0753EDT\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  1136 4340 \par \par \uc2 Dokument cm00000020011006dta7024f2\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
