\par\par \b \uc2  INDONESIA C.BANK GOVERNOR CALLS MOVE A FREE FLOAT. \b0\par\par\uc2 315 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 14 August 1997\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1997 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  JAKARTA, Aug 14 (Reuter) - Indonesian \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  governor Sudradjad Djiwandono said on Thursday that the lifting of the bank's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  band implied a free float of the rupiah although it reserved the right to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  if needed. \par \par \uc2  "Theoretically, it's a free float," he told Reuters Financial Television in an interview. "But of course Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  would like to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  to keep developments on course, to smooth the adaptment period. \par \par \uc2  "Our job as the \b \highlight22\uc2 monetary authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  is to provide a good climate for the business sector," he said. \par \par \uc2  Djiwandono said that the move had led to rapid falls in the rupiah but he hoped the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  would level off. \par \par \uc2  "We hope it will lead to a new equilibrium," he said. "The equilibrium may not be a fixed point, it could be an area." \par \par \uc2  He added that the decision to do away with the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  band was taken with careful consideration. \par \par \uc2  "It does not mean we are going haywire," he said. \par \par \uc2  Djiwandono also said there would be no move to introduce exchange controls on the rupiah. \par \par \uc2  "Why should we control?" he said when asked if there was a possibility of any such move." \par \par \uc2  He said the float of the rupiah was in response to similar moves undertaken by the Philippines and Thailand in recent weeks. \par \par \uc2  "We are a regional market now. We are moving together," Djiwandono said. \par \par \uc2  "In the last few weeks Indonesia is the only one which had a band, it's the only one defending the rupiah," he said adding that maintaining that position would be more and more difficult. \par \par \uc2  "We are adjusting to the new realities," he said. "The new reality in the ASEAN (Association of South East Asian Nations) region is floating (\b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 )." \par \par \uc2  -- Jakarta newsroom (6221) 384-6364; Fax (6221) 344-8404 \par \par \uc2  -- Email: jakarta.newsroom@reuters.com \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1997 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011002dt8e019ja\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
