\par\par \b \uc2  Bank Indonesia/Rupiah/Amplifier -2: Dlr Trending Higher \b0\par\par\uc2 345 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 13 August 1997\par 14:45\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market grew bolder hours later on news Indonesia's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  governor and finance minister had scheduled a lunch time press conference. Speculation centered on the possible announcement of a free-floating policy, but the meeting turned out to be a tutorial for the local media on coverage of the rupiah's woes. The foreign press was barred from the meeting. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  Governor Soedradjad Djiwandono instructed the chief editors of local papers to be less alarmist and speculative in their reporting, according to those in attendance. But in a comment that could be perceived as a tip-off, he also said the government 'would use all of its monetary tools' to stabilize the nation's \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  At around the same time, 0600 GMT, the U.S. dollar penetrated the top of its trading band against the rupiah, reaching a high of 2,682 rupiah bid. It was the first time the top end of the band has been broken during the recent spat of regional \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  attacks. \par \par \uc2  Just a half an hour later, however, the U.S. dollar plunged to an intraday low of 2,630 rupiah on what traders said was a massive Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , involving the sale of around $200 million. Other traders believe that Bank Indonesia spent as much as $500 million. \par \par \uc2  The dollar gradually began to trend upward to the weak end of the rupiah band, which was again set by Bank Indonesia at 2,378 rupiah to 2,682 rupiah. The dollar closed Asian trading Thursday at 2,670 rupiah. \par \par \uc2  Swap rates also finished Thursday higher, with the overnight swap rate rising to 1.00 rupiah-1.20 rupiah from 0.90 rupiah-1.20 rupiah earlier in the day. One-week swap rates rose to 7.50 rupiah-9.00 rupiah from 5.50 rupiah 6.00 rupiah. One-month swap rates increased to 30.00 rupiah-38.00 rupiah from 25.00 rupiah-33.00 rupiah. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 13-08-97 \par \par \uc2  1245GMT \par \par \uc2  1194 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt8d05xy0\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
