\par\par \b \uc2  Bank Indonesia Rupiah Defense Seen Futile - Amplifier \b0\par\par\uc2  By Jay Solomon \par \uc2 296 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 13 August 1997\par 14:02\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JAKARTA (AP-Dow Jones)--\b \highlight22\uc2 Currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  speculators Wednesday pushed the Indonesian rupiah through the weak end of Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  band and sparked numerous - though unconfirmed - reports that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  spent upwards of $200 million \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  in defense of its \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  This apparent action did succeed in pushing the rupiah back within its 12% band, but traders in Singapore and Jakarta remain convinced an eventual second attack on the rupiah's band is inevitable. \par \par \uc2  Many economists assert a defense of the rupiah is justified on grounds it's undervalued, but also concede the speculative fervor currently in the market likely makes such a defense futile. \par \par \uc2  'The Indonesian authorities are in a very difficult situation with no real answers,' said Don Hanna, a regional economist at Goldman Sachs & Co. in Hong Kong. 'We certainly believe the rupiah is fairly valued within its current band. But at the same time, we don't want to see Indonesia falling on its own sword defending it.' \par \par \uc2  Pressure on the rupiah has been felt all week on the back of continued speculative attacks against regional \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  and a strengthening of the U.S. dollar globally. \par \par \uc2  But early Wednesday, the attack intensified, as traders at offshore banks began selling the rupiah for U.S. dollars as rumors swept the Singapore market that Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  was preparing to abandon its current 12% \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  band in favor of a freely floating \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . Indonesian companies were also seen buying dollars to hedge against rupiah exposure. \par \par \uc2  Bank Indonesia responded by raising the rates of its Sertifikat Bank Indonesia (SBI) money-market paper across the board by 100 basis points. But little support was seen. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 13-08-97 \par \par \uc2  1202GMT \par \par \uc2  1194 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt8d05xs4\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
