\par\par \b \uc2  Indonesia's Rupiah Lower Late, But Above 2,685-Rupiah Nadir \b0\par\par\uc2 291 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 13 August 1997\par 12:25\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JAKARTA (AP-Dow Jones)--Indonesia's rupiah was trading lower against the U.S. dollar in subdued dealings late Wednesday, but off its new low of 2,685 rupiah, after Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  was said to have \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the spot market, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  The dollar was trading at 2,665 rupiah in the spot market at 1010 GMT (6:10 a.m. EDT), compared with Tuesday's close at 2,648 rupiah. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said that the rupiah broke through the upper band of the trading band at 2,682 rupiah as the market buzzed with speculation about the closed-door meeting between the Finance Minister, the Bank Indonesia Governor and chief editors of local media. \par \par \uc2  The meeting turned out to be just a briefing on the current situation in the domestic and regional \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets, and was not a policy statement. \par \par \uc2  But, Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  still had to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the spot market to show its commitment to defend the rupiah, dealers said. That \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  drove the dollar down to an intraday low of 2,630 rupiah. \par \par \uc2  Officials with Bank Indonesia were not available late Wednesday for confirmation, but market participants believed that the nation's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  might have spent between $100 million and $500 million in the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Earlier in the day, Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  raised the rates of the Sertifikat Bank Indonesia (SBI) across the board by 100 basis points in a move to defend the rupiah. \par \par \uc2  After the dollar broke the upper band, market speculation was rife that the band could be widened. Bank Indonesia, however, left the band unchanged at 2,378 rupiah-2,682 rupiah. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 13-08-97 \par \par \uc2  1025GMT \par \par \uc2  1159 1848 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt8d05xdd\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
