\par\par \b \uc2  Indonesia Rupiah Higher Vs Dlr; Offshore Buying Interests \b0\par\par\uc2 281 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 7 August 1997\par 07:29\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JAKARTA (AP-Dow Jones)--Indonesia's rupiah continues to strengthen Thursday against the U.S. dollar on strong offshore buying interest, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  Dealers note as well that domestic buying of dollars - needed in recent weeks to cover offshore dollar debt - has diminished, also supporting the rupiah. \par \par \uc2  The U.S. unit is being bought at 2,587 rupiah in the spot market at 0517 GMT (1:17 a.m. EDT) Thursday, slightly lower from Wednesday's close of 2,588 rupiah. The dollar fell to a low of 2,581 rupiah at 0122 GMT (9:22 p.m. EDT) Thursday before rebounding. \par \par \uc2  'The market realizes the demand for buying dollars is subsiding,' said Pardi Kandy, a \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealer at PT Mitsubishi Bank Buana in Jakarta. 'Offshore funds are now coming back into the market to take advantage of the attractive fixed-income yields in Indonesia.' \par \par \uc2  Bank Indonesia continues to keep an extremely tight money policy, with Surat Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  money market \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  contracts still yielding an attractive 14% to investors. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  also continues to restrict issuances of its Surat Berharga Pasar Uang contracts. \par \par \uc2  But traders say money market rates are starting to trend down in anticipation of Bank Indonesia eventually loosening its stance. Overnight rupiah deposits have come down to 15% from 20% Wednesday, as have overnight swap rates. 'The market is keeping one step ahead of the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 ,' Pardi said. \par \par \uc2  Because of this renewed interest in the rupiah, traders see the dollar trading Thursday in a range between 2,570 rupiah and 2,590 rupiah. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 07-08-97 \par \par \uc2  0529GMT \par \par \uc2  (Corrected 0702GMT) \par \par \uc2  1159 1848 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt8705t2w\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
