\par\par \b \uc2  INDONESIAN RUPIAH STRENGTHENS, LIQUIDITY EASES. \b0\par\par\uc2 516 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 7 August 1997\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1997 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  JAKARTA, Aug 7 (Reuter) - The Indonesian rupiah strengthened against the dollar amid improved money market liquidity in early trading on Thursday, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  They said confidence seemed to have returned and sentiment on the rupiah turned upbeat after a \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  meeting with foreign bank representatives on Wednesday did not discuss \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  controls. \par \par \uc2  "This seems to have given a boost to market sentiment," one U.S. bank dealer said, adding further uptrend in the rupiah was likely later in the day. \par \par \uc2  The bank confirmed talks between its governor and foreign bank representatives late on Wednesday, but the talks were not about controls of swap transactions. \par \par \uc2  It said they were exchanging views about the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market. \b \highlight22\uc2 Currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealers said the market was rife with rumours that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was planning to introduce similar steps as taken by the Malaysian \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to limit swap transactions which were not trade related. \par \par \uc2  One Japanese bank dealer said the confirmation gave the market confidence that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had no plan to introduce radical steps and would be content with existing instruments. \par \par \uc2  Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  had widened its \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  band as signs of possible speculative attacks brewed. The early anticipation helped safe the country's valuable reserves. \par \par \uc2  The bank later tightened rupiah liquidity and raised short-term interest rates to contain speculative dollar buying. \par \par \uc2  Treasurers said the high short-term interest rate policy would be temporary and perhaps eased as \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets stabilised. \par \par \uc2  Spot rupiah rose to 2,581.5/83.0 at 0210 GMT from an opening of 2,586.0/91.0. Tomorrow and today rupiah were at 2,580.5/82.0 and 2,580.0/81.5, respectively. \par \par \uc2  The U.S. bank dealer said he expected the rupiah to range between 2,575 and 2,590 for the rest of the day. \par \par \uc2  "We see foreign players continuing to unload dollars while domestic purchases have declined," he said, adding that some big local banks were also unloading dollars despite improved money market liquidity. \par \par \uc2  Overnight money ranged between 15.0 and 17.0 percent, compared with 25-30 percent on Wednesday morning. \par \par \uc2  "If domestic dollar purchases ease and the region's markets continue to stabilise, the market will be trying to break the 2,570 barrier very soon and the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will loosen its short-term interest rate policy," another dealer said. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said swaps were lower, with and tending to ease after the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  meeting on Wednesday suggested there were no plans to copy Malaysian or Thai measures of swap controls. \par \par \uc2  Overnight swap was at 0.55/0.60 and tom/next at 1.2/1.3. \par \par \uc2  One-month swap was at 18.0/22.0, two at 37.0/42.0, three at 55.0/62.0 and six at 118.0/125.0 points. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  kept its \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  band at 2,378/2,682 but lowered the conversion band to 2,572/2,620 on Wednesday from 2,576/2,624 on Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  -- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364 \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1997 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011002dt8701hkn\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
