\par\par \b \uc2  Bk Indonesia: Dlr Range Of 2,555-2,610 Rupiah OK - Paper \b0\par\par\uc2 240 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 30 Juli 1997\par 05:43\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JAKARTA (AP-Dow Jones)--Indonesia \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  Deputy Governor Paul Soetopo said that a U.S. dollar trading range of between 2,555 rupiah and 2,610 rupiah against the Indonesian rupiah is reasonable in light of the continued instability in Southeast Asian \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 , Indonesia daily Bisnis Indonesia reported Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  The paper quoted Soetopo as saying that the rupiah's exchange rate is basically determined by economic fundamentals, but that it is also being determined by technical factors that affect supply and demand. \par \par \uc2  Soetopo added, however, said that under the current situation, it is almost impossible to determine the rupiah's equilibrium based solely on economic fundamentals. \par \par \uc2  'The equilibrium level of between 2,555 rupiah and 2,610 rupiah is reasonable for the short-term,' Soetopo said. He added that Bank Indonesia will tolerate this level as long as the rupiah remains within Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  band. \par \par \uc2  Earlier Thursday the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  band remained set at 2,378 rupiah to 2,682 rupiah. At 0323 GMT (10:35 p.m EST) the U.S. dollar is trading at 2,537.50 rupiah, down from an opening of 2,578 rupiah. \par \par \uc2  He said that Bank Indonesia will not set a fixed figure for the market equilibrium, as it could only fuel more speculative attacks against the rupiah, the report said. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 30-07-97 \par \par \uc2  0343GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt7u05jtg\par }\par